# Copper sketch of the survey board: only the parameters the BGA planners read (plane clearance, minimum width) and
# a whole-layer ground plane on L2. No power blocks (the survey has no supply plan).
origin 100 100
planes L2 L5
gap 0.5
clearance 0.2
plane_clearance 0.127
minwidth 0.2

region L2_GND GND L2 whole
